 required to:\n1. Verify the BGP configurations and routing tables across the Clos fabric, especially at the spine and super spine levels.\n2. Check for any misconfigurations or failures in the inter-router links and service subnets.\n3. Analyze logs and counters from the routers and switches to identify anomalies.\n\nThis concludes the initial diagnostic report.", "generation_info": {"finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 5842, "output_tokens": 518, "total_tokens": 6360, "input_token_details": {"audio": 0, "cache_read": 5760}, "output_token_details": {"audio": 0, "reasoning": 0}}}
